{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zwEVubVUmv1793271372.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙上邨目前仍然無食水供應，水務署在普善樓、達善樓及啟善樓安排水車，為居民臨時供水，晚飯時間陸續有居民取水。水務署未交代爆水管原因，初步估計凌晨3點才恢復供水。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:33.389646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.452692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:21.407453+00:00","content_hash":"0402899c0cd290f50d5283c7ddfeba68a4362b0b5a2bdaa40865447db0b77feb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:33.389646+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}